{"unit_id": "tag:0G44:proof", "translation": "写作<MATH_0001>，其中取某个<MATH_0002>-模（module）<MATH_0003>。置\n<MATH_0004>。设<MATH_0005>是一个阶（order）为<MATH_0006>的微分算子（differential operator）。我们要证明存在唯一的微分算子（differential operator）<MATH_0007>，其阶（order）为<MATH_0008>，并在整体截面（global sections）上诱导出<MATH_0009>。设<MATH_0010>为标准仿射开集（affine open）。则<MATH_0011>为相应的局部化（localization）。由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>，微分算子（differential operator）<MATH_0012>唯一地延拓为微分算子（differential operator）\n<MATH_0013>\n由唯一性可知，这些映射（maps）<MATH_0014>粘合成层（sheaves）之间的一个映射（map）\n<MATH_0015>\n，定义在<MATH_0016>的全体标准开集（standard opens）所成的基（basis）上。因此可得到与这些映射（maps）一致的唯一的层（sheaves）间映射（map）\n<MATH_0017>，这由《层（Sheaves）》一章第<REF_0002>节的内容可知。\n由于<MATH_0018>在各标准开集（standard opens）上由阶（order）为<MATH_0019>的微分算子（differential operators）给出，可知<MATH_0020>是阶（order）为<MATH_0021>的微分算子（differential operator）（一处小（small）细节略去）。\n最后，可将典范（canonical）的<MATH_0022>-模映射（module map）\n<MATH_0023>\n（见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0003>）后复合，得到<MATH_0024>，它是阶（order）为<MATH_0025>的微分算子（differential operator），见《模（Modules）》引理<REF_0004>。\n这就证明了存在性。唯一性的证明略去。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "order", "target_term": "阶"}, {"source_term": "differential operator", "target_term": "微分算子"}, {"source_term": "differential operator", "target_term": "微分算子"}, {"source_term": "order", "target_term": "阶"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "differential operator", "target_term": "微分算子"}, {"source_term": "differential operator", "target_term": "微分算子"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映