{"unit_id": "tag:0G45:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）。\n设<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0005>-模（modules）。\n设<MATH_0006>是阶（order）为<MATH_0007>、定义在<MATH_0008>上的微分算子（differential operator）。设<MATH_0009>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0010>-模（module）。则存在唯一的微分算子（differential operator）\n<MATH_0011>\n，其阶（order）为<MATH_0012>，定义在<MATH_0013>上，满足\n<MATH_0014>\n，其中<MATH_0015>是<MATH_0016>的局部截面（local sections），<MATH_0017>是<MATH_0018>的局部截面。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "order", "target_term": "阶"}, {"source_term": "differential operator", "target_term": "微分算子"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "differential operator", "target_term": "微分算子"}, {"source_term": "order", "target_term": "阶"}, {"source_term": "local sections", "target_term": "局部截面"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源和靶所属的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的两个概形之间的态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "规定前两个模的性质"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "给定的两个模"}, {"source_term": "order", "target_term": "阶", "context": "规定给定算子的阶"}, {"source_term": "differential operator", "target_term": "微分算子", "context": "给定的算子"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "规定第三个模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "给定的第三个模"}, {"source_term": "differential operator", "target_term": "微分算子", "context": "断言存在且唯一的算子"}, {"source_term": "order", "target_term": "阶", "context": "规定所求算子的阶"}, {"source_term": "local sections", "target_term": "局部截面", "context": "公式中取用的两类截面"}], "not