{"unit_id": "tag:0G45:proof", "translation": "当<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>均为仿射的（affine）时，由引理<REF_0001>，结论归结为相应的代数（algebra）结果，见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>。\n一般情形下，利用由仿射概形（affines）组成的覆盖（coverings）（例如《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0003>中所用的覆盖），在整体上构造<MATH_0004>。细节略去。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "限定先处理的概形情形"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "描述仿射情形所用的结果"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "被引章节名称"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "构成覆盖的概形"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "从仿射情形推广至整体的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "被引章节名称"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0G46:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）。将投影（projections）记为<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>。\n在本注记中，给定一个<MATH_0005>-模（module）<MATH_0006>和一个<MATH_0007>-模（module）<MATH_0008>，置\n<MATH_0009>\n以<MATH_0010>表示一个加性（additive）的范畴（category），其对象（objects）是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0011>-模（modules），其态射（morphisms）是阶有限（finite）的、定义在<MATH_0012>上的微分算子（differential operators）。\n<MATH_0013>和<MATH_0014>类似。\n引理<REF_0001>中的构造确定了一个函子（functor）\n<MATH_0015>\n，它在态射（morphisms）上是双线性的（bilinear）。若<MATH_0016>、<MATH_0017>和<MATH_0018>，则通过将拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）与模（modules）等同，这个函子（functor）在对象（objects）上由<MATH_0019>给出，并将态射（morphism）<MATH_0020>送到\n<MATH_0021>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "projections", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "additive", "target_term": "加性"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "differential operators", "target_term": "微分算子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "bilinear", "target_term": "双线性的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射所涉及的概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的两个态射"}, {"source_term": "projections", "target_term": "投影", "context": "给定记号所指的投影"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "构造所用的第一个模"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "构造所用的第二个模"}, {"source_term": "additive", "target_term": "加性", "context": "说明范畴的加性"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "按对象和态射定义的范畴"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象", "context": "范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定作为对象的模"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "构成对象的模"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴的态射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "限定微分算子的阶"}, {"source_term": "differential operators", "target_term": "微分算子", "context": "构成态射的算子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "由引理构造确定的函子"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "说明函子的双线性作用"}, {"source_term": "bilinear", "target_term": "双线性的", "context": "限定函子在态射上的作用"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "用于等同的层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "与拟凝聚层等同的模"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "描述在对象及态射上的作用"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象", "context": "函子作用的第一部分"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给出函子作用的具体态射"}], "notes": []}
