{"unit_id": "tag:01V4:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间的连续（continuous）映射（map）。考虑如下条件：\n对每个<MATH_0002>，存在开邻域（open neighbourhoods）<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>，以及一个整数（integer）<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>，并得到交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0007>\n其中<MATH_0008>是到某个开子集（open subset）上的同胚（homeomorphism）。\n在概形（schemes）的范畴（category）中，概形（schemes）的光滑（Smooth）态射（morphisms）与这类映射（maps）相对应。见引理<REF_0001>和引理<REF_0002>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n或许出乎意料，光滑（smooth）环映射（ring map）的概念并非仅用微分（differentials）模（module）来定义。具体地说，回顾如下定义：<MATH_0009>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>光滑（smooth）环映射（ring map）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若<MATH_0010>在<MATH_0011>上是有限表示（finite presentation）的，并且<MATH_0012>在<MATH_0013>上的朴素余切复形（naive cotangent complex）拟同构（quasi-isomorphic）于置于次数（degree）<MATH_0014>的一个投射（projective）模（module），见《代数（Algebra）》定义<REF_0003>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_ter