{"unit_id": "tag:01V5:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 称<MATH_0002><TEXTITOPEN_0001>在<MATH_0003>处光滑（smooth at）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若存在仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0004>作为<MATH_0005>的邻域（neighbourhood），以及仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0006>，满足<MATH_0007>，且诱导的环映射（ring map）<MATH_0008>是光滑（smooth）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 称<MATH_0009>是<TEXTITOPEN_0002>光滑（smooth）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>的，若它在<MATH_0010>的每一点处都光滑（smooth at）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 仿射概形（affine schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>标准光滑（standard smooth）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>的，若存在标准光滑（standard smooth）的环映射（ring map）<MATH_0012>（见《代数（Algebra）》定义<REF_0001>），使得<MATH_0013>同构（isomorphic）于\n<MATH_0014>\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth at", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "smooth at", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "standard smooth", "target_term": "标准光滑"}, {"source_term": "standard smooth", "target_term": "标准光滑"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源和靶所属的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的概形态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth at", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "定义在给定点处的光滑性"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "取作邻域的第一个仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "第一个仿射开集须包含给定点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "定义中另一个仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "由限制诱导的映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "对诱导环映射的要求"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "定义态射光滑的性质"}, {"source_term": "smooth at", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "要求在源的每一点处光滑"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "标准光滑定义涉及的源和靶"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "标准光滑定义涉及的态射"}, {"source_term": "standard smooth", "target_term": "标准光滑", "context": "为仿射概形态射定义的性质"}, {"source_term": "standard smooth", "target_term": "标准光滑", "context": "限定用于该定义的环映射"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "标准光滑定义所要求的环映射"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "被引章节名称"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "要求给定态射与指定态射同构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V4:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这个定义有一个可喜的特点，即态射（morphism）为光滑（smooth）的点的集合（set）自然是开的（open）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n注意定义中没有分离性（separation）或拟紧性（quasi-compactness）的假设。因此，是否光滑（smooth）本质上是源（source）上的局部（local）问题。下面给出确切的结论。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开的"}, {"source_term": "separation", "target_term": "分离性"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compactness", "target_term": "拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "source", "target_term": "源"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "考察其在哪些点光滑的态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "所考察的点态性质"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "态射光滑的点所成的集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开的", "context": "说明光滑点集的拓扑性质"}, {"source_term": "separation", "target_term": "分离性", "context": "定义未要求的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compactness", "target_term": "拟紧性", "context": "定义未要求的另一性质"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "讨论其局部性的性质"}, {"source_term": "source", "target_term": "源", "context": "说明局部性所针对的一侧"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "表述光滑性在源上的局部性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V6:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>是光滑（smooth）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对于任意满足下述条件的仿射开集（affine opens）<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>，即<MATH_0005>，环映射（ring map）<MATH_0006>是光滑（smooth）的。\n<STRUCT_0004> 存在开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>和开覆盖（coverings）<MATH_0008>，使得态射（morphisms）<MATH_0009>、<MATH_0010>中的每一个都是光滑（smooth）的。\n<STRUCT_0005> 存在一个由仿射开集（affine open）组成的覆盖（covering）<MATH_0011>和一些仿射开覆盖（affine open coverings）<MATH_0012>，使得环映射（ring map）<MATH_0013>是光滑（smooth）的，对所有<MATH_0014>均如此。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n此外，若<MATH_0015>是光滑（smooth）的，则对任意满足下述条件的开子概形（open subschemes）<MATH_0016>、<MATH_0017>，即<MATH_0018>，限制（restriction）<MATH_0019>是光滑（smooth）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine open coverings", "target_term": "仿射开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源和靶所属的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "说明各判据之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一项所述的态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "第一项中态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第二项中任取的两个开集"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "第二项中须光滑的映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "第二项要求环映射具备的性质"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第三项中存在的一个开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第三项中存在的一族开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第三项所列的态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "第三项对所列态射的要求"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "组成第四项第一个覆盖的开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第四项中由仿射开集组成的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine open coverings", "target_term": "仿射开覆盖", "context": "第四项中存在的一族仿射开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "第四项所考察的环映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "第四项对环映射的要求"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "附加断言的前提"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "取限制时任取的开子概形"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "在开子概形上所得的态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "附加断言对限制给出的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V6:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>可知，只需证明性质“<MATH_0001>是光滑（smooth）的”是局部（local）的。\n我们验证定义<REF_0002>中的条件（a）、（b）和（c）。\n由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0003>，光滑（smooth）性在基变换（base change）下保持，因此（a）成立。由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0004>，光滑（smooth）性在复合（composition）下保持，并且对任意环（ring）<MATH_0002>，环映射（ring map）<MATH_0003>是（标准）光滑（smooth）的。因此（b）成立。最后，由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0005>，条件（c）成立。\n", "allowed_english": ["a", "b", "c"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "待证为局部性质的性质"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "要验证的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "证明条件（a）所引章节"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "在基变换下保持的性质"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "条件（a）涉及的运算"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "证明条件（b）所引章节"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "在复合下保持的性质"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "条件（b）涉及的运算"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "条件（b）中任取的环"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "条件（b）中判断其光滑性的映射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "该环映射具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "证明条件（c）所引章节"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V4:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下述引理将光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）刻画为具有光滑（smooth）纤维（fibres）的平坦（flat）、有限表示（finitely presented）的态射（morphism）。\n注意，域（field）上的光滑（smooth）概形（schemes）在《簇（Varieties）》第<REF_0001>节中有更详细的讨论。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Varieties", "target_term": "簇"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "需要刻画的态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理刻画的对象"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "对纤维的要求"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "刻画中要求光滑的对象"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "作为刻画的条件之一"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "作为刻画的条件之一"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "满足所列条件的对象"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "作为光滑概形的基底"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "描述该处所讨论的概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "在所引章节中讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "Varieties", "target_term": "簇", "context": "被引章节名称"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V8:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n若<MATH_0002>是平坦（flat）的、局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的，且所有纤维（fibres）<MATH_0003>都是光滑（smooth）的，则<MATH_0004>是光滑（smooth）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源和靶所属的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "态射的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示", "context": "态射的第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "必须全部光滑的对象"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "对全部纤维的要求"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "结论中得到的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
