{"unit_id": "tag:01VA:statement", "translation": "两个光滑（smooth）态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）是光滑（smooth）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "对两个给定态射的共同要求"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "参与复合的两个态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "对两个态射所作的运算"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "复合所得的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01VA:proof", "translation": "在引理<REF_0001>的证明中，我们已看到光滑（smooth）性是环映射（ring maps）的局部性质（local property）。\n因此，由引理<REF_0002>，结合光滑（smooth）性作为环映射（ring maps）的性质在复合（composition）下保持这一事实，即得本引理的第一个断言。关于这一事实，见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "local property", "target_term": "局部性质"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "先前已证明为局部性质的性质"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "局部性质所针对的映射"}, {"source_term": "local property", "target_term": "局部性质", "context": "说明光滑性是局部的"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "在环映射的复合下保持的性质"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "复合下保持光滑性的映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "所述性质在此运算下保持"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "复合下保持光滑性的出处"}], "notes": []}
