{"unit_id": "tag:01V4:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下述引理表明，任意光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）在局部（locally）都是标准光滑（smooth）的。因此，可以用标准光滑（smooth）态射（morphisms）作为光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>局部模型（local model）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "local model", "target_term": "局部模型"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "所述局部刻画的假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "被局部刻画的对象"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部", "context": "限定标准光滑性质成立的范围"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "与标准一词连用，描述局部得到的性质"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "与标准一词连用，限定用作局部模型的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "用作局部模型的对象"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "限定由局部模型描述的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "局部模型所描述的对象"}, {"source_term": "local model", "target_term": "局部模型", "context": "标准光滑态射所起的作用"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01V7:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>为一点（point）。设<MATH_0003>是仿射开集（affine open），且是<MATH_0004>的邻域（neighbourhood）。\n下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>处光滑（smooth）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0007>，满足<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>，且诱导的态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>是标准光滑（smooth）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源和靶所属的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理中给定的态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "引理给定的点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "取作给定点邻域的开集"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "说明仿射开集与给定点的关系"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "说明两项条件之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一项所考察的态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "第一项对态射在给定点处的要求"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第二项断言存在的开集"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二项的诱导态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "与标准一词连用，描述诱导态射的性质"}], "notes": []}
